<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="AB Bespoke Home. Luxury remodels, additions, and new construction in Sacramento. Explore a thoughtful approach to building your home."/><meta name="robots" content="noindex"/><title>AB Bespoke Home | Your Home, Built to Suit</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/></head><body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header><a href="#" aria-label="AB Bespoke Home homepage" class="logo"><img src="/images/0.png" alt="AB Bespoke Home"/></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation" id="navigation"><a href="#work">Our work</a><a href="#approach">Our approach</a><a href="#about">About us</a><a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">Start building <span>↗</span></a></nav><button class="menu" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navigation">Menu <span>＋</span></button></header>
<main id="main"><section class="hero"><img class="hero-image" src="/images/4.jpg" alt="AB Bespoke kitchen with deep blue cabinetry, brass hardware, and a bright white island" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="hero-shade"></div><div class="hero-content"><p class="eyebrow">SACRAMENTO, CALIFORNIA · DESIGN & BUILD</p><h1>Your Home,<br/>Built to Suit.</h1><div class="hero-bottom"><p>Luxury remodels, additions,<br/>& new construction in Sacramento.</p><a class="button light" href="#work">Explore our work <span>↗</span></a></div></div><a class="scroll" href="#intro">A HOME THAT'S YOURS <span>↓</span></a></section>
<section id="intro" class="intro wrap"><p class="eyebrow">THE AB BESPOKE APPROACH</p><div><h2>A home that reflects you.<br/><span>A process that respects your time.</span></h2><div class="intro-bottom"><p>You’ve built a life with purpose and integrity, and you deserve a home that serves as your sanctuary—a space you can enjoy with the people you care about most.</p><a class="text-link" href="#approach">Get to know our process <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section id="work" class="work wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A CLOSER LOOK</p><h2>Built around real life.</h2></div><p>Detail, style, and function.<br/>A selection of spaces from AB Bespoke Home.</p></div><div class="project-grid"><button class="project wide" data-image="/images/3.jpg" data-title="Kitchen · Light & connection"><div class="photo"><img src="/images/3.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="White kitchen opening into a light-filled dining room"/><span class="round">↗</span></div><div class="caption"><h3>Light & connection</h3><span>KITCHEN</span></div></button><button class="project narrow" data-image="/images/5.jpg" data-title="Bathroom · Considered details"><div class="photo"><img src="/images/5.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="Green bathroom cabinetry with brass fixtures and a framed mirror"/><span class="round">↗</span></div><div class="caption"><h3>Considered details</h3><span>BATHROOM</span></div></button></div><button class="project landscape" data-image="/images/2.jpg" data-title="Exterior · A place to come home to"><div class="photo"><img src="/images/2.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="Renovated white home with a natural wood front door and landscaped entry"/><span class="round">↗</span></div><div class="caption"><h3>A place to come home to</h3><span>EXTERIOR</span></div></button></section>
<section id="services" class="services"><div class="wrap services-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">ROOM TO REIMAGINE</p><h2>Wherever you are<br/>in your home's story.</h2><p>From ground-up construction of entire homes to smaller one-of-a-kind spaces, we approach every project with an eye for detail, style, and function.</p><img src="/images/6.jpg" alt="Custom kitchen with a garden view" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="service-list">{services.map(([n,t,d,url])=><a href={`https://www.ab-bespoke.com/${url}`}><span class="number">{n}</span><div><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p></div><span class="arrow">↗</span></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section id="approach" class="process wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THOUGHTFUL PLANNING. THOROUGH PREPARATION.</p><h2>Build your home<br/>without the headache.</h2></div><p>Before the first hammer is swung, we work through the decisions that make your project possible.</p></div><div class="steps"><article><span class="number">01 / LET'S TALK</span><h3>Tell us what you have in mind.</h3><p>Share your project goals, timeline, and expected budget. An introductory call helps us understand your needs and see if we’re a good fit.</p></article><article><span class="number">02 / MAKE A PLAN</span><h3>Build it on paper first.</h3><p>Through preconstruction, we work through design decisions, materials, scope, scheduling, and budget, coordinating the professionals your project needs.</p></article><article><span class="number">03 / START BUILDING</span><h3>Watch your home take shape.</h3><p>With the plan in place, our team gets to work. Clear communication keeps you connected to what’s happening in your home.</p></article></div><a class="text-link" href="https://www.ab-bespoke.com/our-process">Explore the full process <span>↗</span></a></section>
<section class="guarantee wrap"><p class="eyebrow">OUR SIGNATURE GUARANTEE</p><h2>Confidence starts<br/>with a clear plan.</h2><div><p>For clients who commit to our full preconstruction process, our Signature Guarantee keeps the final project price within 3% of the final bid provided.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.ab-bespoke.com/signature-guarantee">Understand our guarantee <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
<section id="about" class="about wrap"><div class="owner-image"><img src="/images/team0.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="Aaron and Allison Byrne, AB Bespoke Home owners"/></div><div><p class="eyebrow">THE PEOPLE BEHIND YOUR HOME</p><h2>A personal approach.<br/>A shared sense of pride.</h2><p>AB Bespoke Home is a family-owned business serving busy professionals who want a home that reflects their lives.</p><p>For owner Aaron Byrne, building began with childhood weekends helping his dad. A career in management consulting sharpened his approach to problem-solving and communication. Today, he brings both experiences to the homes we build.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.ab-bespoke.com/meet-the-team">Meet Aaron & the team <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="contact"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</p><h2>Let’s build<br/>something personal.</h2><div class="contact-bottom"><p>Tell us about your home,<br/>and what you have in mind.</p><a class="button light" href="https://www.ab-bespoke.com/contact">Start building <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</main><footer class="wrap"><a class="footer-logo" href="#"><img src="/images/0.png" alt="AB Bespoke Home"/></a><p>YOUR HOME, BUILT TO SUIT.<br/><span>Sacramento, California</span></p><div><a href="mailto:aaron@ab-bespoke.com">aaron@ab-bespoke.com</a><a href="tel:+19164000357">(916) 400-0357</a></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} AB Bespoke Home</span><a href="#">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer>
